- **Sandbox** — free play comparing boxcar vs Lee ENL across windows.
**Sources:** 5 entries (Lee 1980, Frost 1982, Argenti et al. 2013, scikit-image NL-means docs, Oliver & Quegan) — all from `sources.md`, papers carry author+year, no rot-prone hosts.
